$ moolah profile create $TMP/card.csv    # answers: 2 | y | 3 | ILS | 2 | USD |  | 2 |  | 3 | isracard | s
Saved profile isracard in this book.
Import the file with: moolah import $TMP/card.csv --account <account>
Change the profile later with: moolah profile edit isracard
File: CSV, 4 transaction rows.
   1  "סכום עסקה" (for example "123.40", "45.00", "1200.00")
   2  "סכום חיוב" (for example "123.40", "165.30", "100.00")
Which column is the amount? [1]: Line 2: "סופר שוק" shows 123.40 in "סכום חיוב". Did money leave the account? [Y/n]:    1  none: the account's currency
   2  "מטבע עסקה" (for example "₪", "$")
   3  "מטבע חיוב" (for example "₪")
Which column is the currency of the amount? [1]: What currency is "₪"? Type its code, for example USD, EUR or ILS: For a purchase in another currency, a card export often shows the original amount too.
   1  none
   2  "סכום עסקה" (for example "123.40", "45.00", "1200.00")
Which column is the original amount? [1]: What currency is "$"? Type its code, for example USD, EUR or ILS: Payee (description): "שם בית העסק" (for example "סופר שוק", "AMAZON", "איקאה"). Right? [Y/n]:    1  none
   2  "הערות" (for example "תשלום 3 מתוך 12")
Which column has extra details to keep as the note? [1]: Line 4 has "תשלום 3 מתוך 12" in "הערות". Is this payment 3 of 12 of a purchase in installments? [Y/n]: Column "סטטוס" has only these values. Some exports mark rows that are not final yet (pending).
   1  none: import every row
   2  "סופית" (3 rows)
   3  "בקליטה" (1 row)
Skip the rows with which value? [1]: Profile name (for example the bank's name) [card]: 
   1  date         "תאריך עסקה", dd/mm/yyyy
   2  amount       "סכום חיוב" (positive = money out)
   3  currency     "מטבע חיוב" (₪ = ILS)
   4  foreign      original amount "סכום עסקה" in "מטבע עסקה" (₪ = ILS, $ = USD)
   5  payee        "שם בית העסק"
   6  note         "הערות"
   7  reference    none
   8  charge date  none
   9  installments "הערות", pattern '(\d+) מתוך (\d+)'
  10  skip rows    rows with "בקליטה" in "סטטוס"
  11  read until   the end of the file
  12  name         isracard

The file as it would be imported (3 rows):
  line 2    2026-10-01  סופר שוק                               -123.4
  line 3    2026-10-03  AMAZON                                 -165.3
  line 4    2026-10-05  איקאה                                    -100

[s]ave, [1-12] change a line, [e]dit the profile text, [q]uit [s]: 
$ moolah profile show isracard
name = "isracard"
description = "Created from card.csv"

[detect]
headers = ["תאריך עסקה", "שם בית העסק", "סכום חיוב"]

[table]
skip = [{ column = "סטטוס", contains = "בקליטה" }]

[columns]
date = "תאריך עסקה"
date_format = "02/01/2006"
payee = "שם בית העסק"
memo = "הערות"
amount = "סכום חיוב"
negate = true
currency = "מטבע חיוב"
orig_amount = "סכום עסקה"
orig_currency = "מטבע עסקה"
installment = "הערות"
installment_pattern = '(\d+) מתוך (\d+)'

[currency_map]
"$" = "USD"
"₪" = "ILS"

$ moolah account add isracard --kind card --currency ILS
Added account isracard (ILS).

$ moolah import test $TMP/card.csv --account isracard
Profile isracard, account isracard. Nothing was saved (test only).

Line  Date        Payee          Amount  Category       Status
   2  2026-10-01  סופר שוק  -123.40 ILS  uncategorized  new
   3  2026-10-03  AMAZON    -165.30 ILS  uncategorized  new
   4  2026-10-05  איקאה     -100.00 ILS  uncategorized  new

